# tx1 — MULTI / EXEC
#
# Learn: MULTI starts a transaction; the following commands are only
# QUEUED. EXEC runs them all, back to back, with no other client's
# command in between. DISCARD (or closing the connection) throws the
# queue away, and nothing runs at all.
#
# Task: move 30 from account:a to account:b as one transaction. The
# commands look right, yet the balances never change. Why?
#

MULTI
DECRBY account:a 30
INCRBY account:b 30
